stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created: CREATE SNOWFLAKE.CORE.QUOTA PUQ_AI_STANDARD_QUOTA()

    Created --> Configured: ADD_SHARED_RESOURCE + SET_USER_TAGS + SET_PER_USER_LIMIT

    Configured --> Active: Block enforcement enabled<br/>Evaluation task starts

    Active --> ThresholdWarning: PUQ_DEMO_USER spend >= 50% projected
    ThresholdWarning --> Active: Notification sent (once/24h)

    Active --> NearLimit: PUQ_DEMO_USER spend >= 90% actual
    NearLimit --> Active: Notification sent (once/cycle)

    Active --> Blocked: PUQ_DEMO_USER spend >= limit<br/>Block pipeline evaluates within minutes

    Blocked --> AutoUnblocked: Cycle reset (UTC midnight for daily, 1st for monthly)
    Blocked --> Escalated: Admin changes tag to USAGE_TIER=high<br/>~15 min propagation

    AutoUnblocked --> Active: New period, usage counters reset
    Escalated --> HighTierActive: PUQ_AI_HIGH_TIER_QUOTA evaluates<br/>Higher limit (500 credits)

    HighTierActive --> Active: Admin reverts tag to USAGE_TIER=standard

    note right of Blocked
        Block enforcement: within minutes
        Only AI domains (not warehouses)
        Auto-releases at cycle boundary
    end note

    note right of Escalated
        No double-blocking between quotas
        Pipeline clears old blocks automatically
    end note
